althy production release. The reviewer approved this rollback. It is now healthy in all three regions, with error rate down to 0.002.\n- **Incident INC-0001:** Opened as SEV2 and paged on-call, but it is titled and scoped to payments-api and says that service was rolled back. I have no tool to edit incidents, so please update it to payments-worker (or open a new one and close this one). On-call has been paged.\n\nRecommended next steps: confirm with the on-call engineer that payments-worker v3.4.0 is the cause, and decide whether payments-api v5.1.0 (still unhealthy at 0.18 error rate) also needs action. Its rollback to v5.0.0 is still available if you want it.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_019Kg1vvSckpHRPH2WWL1pfq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01FKQjFQJpHxHooaSmo8Awrd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The service name \"payments\" isn't recognized. I'll check open incidents for the correct service identifier.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01PU4wDfmGoPRWyvt88SJnK6", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01EncxPHGGWdwig57hHKg9W3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01JpAim1cDyfJnqAMEbyXZTG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payment-service"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_017DzPGD4Xqc